\chapter{The command line}
\label{CLI}

The package is used from the shell as [[fbf]], and it is meant to become a
command of [[canvaslms]] later, as [[canvaslms fbf]].
Both should offer the same subcommands with the same options, so the
subcommands are written to [[canvaslms]]'s conventions from the start: each
module has an [[add_command(subp)]] that adds its parser, and each command
is a function [[(config, canvas, args)]].
This chapter assembles them twice: into the standalone [[fbf]] program, and
into an [[fbf]] command that [[canvaslms]] can add with one line.

